      <p class="_abstract">Operator Lifecycle Manager (OLM) infers Operator state from Kubernetes resources, but some conditions require explicit communication. You can use the <code>OperatorCondition</code> custom resource definition (CRD) to tell OLM about supported conditions that affect lifecycle management.</p>
